{"id":"449e27d1ef5267bf","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-lem-hausdorff.md","title":"Hausdorff's Lemma","display":"lem-hausdorff — Hausdorff's Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-hausdorff","aliases":["58-lem-hausdorff"],"display":"lem-hausdorff — Hausdorff's Lemma","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-chain.md]]","[[../batch01/58-ax-ac.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-hausdorff"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-hausdorff</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-hausdorff — Hausdorff's Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a07664003abe8d32\" href=\"?note=a07664003abe8d32\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-chain.md\">../batch17/58-df-chain.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b3dac4cf78c440c7\" href=\"?note=b3dac4cf78c440c7\" title=\"../batch01/58-ax-ac.md\">../batch01/58-ax-ac.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\leq\\in V\">\\(P,\\leq\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq)\">\\(\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a07664003abe8d32\" href=\"?note=a07664003abe8d32\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-chain.md\">../batch17/58-df-chain.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b3dac4cf78c440c7\" href=\"?note=b3dac4cf78c440c7\" title=\"58-ax-ac.md\">58-ax-ac.md</a> 的选择公理。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}hausdorff} \\vdash \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\to\\exists C\\subseteq P\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq)\\land\\forall D\\subseteq P\\;(C\\subseteq D\\land\\mathrm{Chain}(D,P,\\leq)\\to D=C)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}hausdorff} \\vdash \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\to\\exists C\\subseteq P\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq)\\land\\forall D\\subseteq P\\;(C\\subseteq D\\land\\mathrm{Chain}(D,P,\\leq)\\to D=C)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hausdorff's maximal principle states that every partially ordered set has a maximal chain (equivalently, every chain is contained in a maximal chain).</li>\n<li>Over ZF it is equivalent to the axiom of choice.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-chain.md","status":"resolved","id":"a07664003abe8d32","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-chain.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-ax-ac.md","status":"resolved","id":"b3dac4cf78c440c7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-ax-ac.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]) and $\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq)$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-chain.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-chain.md","status":"resolved","id":"a07664003abe8d32","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]) and $\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq)$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-chain.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-ax-ac.md","status":"resolved","id":"b3dac4cf78c440c7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[58-ax-ac.md]] 的选择公理。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,\\leq\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}hausdorff} \\vdash \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\to\\exists C\\subseteq P\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Chain}(C,P,\\leq)\\land\\forall D\\subseteq P\\;(C\\subseteq D\\land\\mathrm{Chain}(D,P,\\leq)\\to D=C)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":959,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3903","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-lem-hausdorff.md|58-lem-hausdorff]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["d3f859dbdd37f018","a07664003abe8d32","b3dac4cf78c440c7"]}